sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Tero et al. (2010) Science & Tero, Kobayashi & Nakagaki (2007) J. Theor. Biol. adaptive Physarum tube conductivity network, shortest-path phase transition, Murray's cube law, and Tokyo rail Pareto trade-off — MorphoEval overall 52.8/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2010-tero-physarum-transport-network.py` (weighted score: 53.6/100). The Pass 1 baseline integrates only a 2-edge parallel ODE at gamma=0.6 and gamma=1.8 without solving the multi-node Kirchhoff linear system sum_j (D_ij/L_ij)*(p_i - p_j) = S_i across stochastic multi-food-source pairs, omits the Tero et al. (2010) Fig. 3/4 phase transition sweep across gamma in [0.6, 2.4] measuring normalized Total Length (TL_MST), Transport Efficiency (MD_MST), and Fault Tolerance (FT), omits Murray's cube law (r_0^3 = r_1^3 + r_2^3) verification at gamma = 4/3, and does not segment the vendored Physarum polycephalum plasmodial specimen photograph. Overall 52.8/100 (faithfulness 50.1, reproducibility 59.2); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 55, Morphological realism / specimen match 45, Parameter expressivity 50, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 56, Reproducibility package 54. Output judged: docs/media/physarum_transport_network_comparison.png: rendered output of 2010-tero-physarum-transport-network.py at 8871db0, image/png, 59424 B, 1300×546 px, artifact_sha256 40760d56079e6ba3af1d59e473c70890055d6b866b417e59f015eb07c79cf4fa (sha256 40760d56079e6ba3af1d59e473c70890055d6b866b417e59f015eb07c79cf4fa), spec_fingerprint a9da85cd52fbe6dcd220e87644d7d896769c3e1c0c8e71bb4976e6e20700a480. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a9da85cd52fbe6dcd220e87644d7d896769c3e1c0c8e71bb4976e6e20700a480; artifact_sha256: 40760d56079e6ba3af1d59e473c70890055d6b866b417e59f015eb07c79cf4fa; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/physarum_transport_network/paper_citations.bib=95f4eb8510791507..., datasets/physarum_transport_network/physarum_polycephalum_specimen.jpg=86a37f7c73c8527b..., datasets/physarum_transport_network/physarum_transport_network_reference.json=4a54186a148929f7..., datasets/physarum_transport_network/scout_manifest.json=edb27b0addb825b3...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement the full graph Laplacian Kirchhoff pressure solver sum_j (D_ij/L_ij)*(p_i - p_j) = S_i coupled to adaptive tube conductivity ODEs across a 2D multi-node Kanto/Physarum food-source network with stochastic source-sink pair switching.",
            "remediation needed: Segment and skeletonize the vendored Physarum polycephalum specimen photograph (`physarum_polycephalum_specimen.jpg`) to extract the vein-width hierarchy, closed anastomosing loop count (Betti-1), and empirical Y-junction Murray cubic radius ratio, backed by SHA-256 integrity checks and a comprehensive `--self-test` suite.",
            "remediation needed: Sweep gamma across [0.6, 2.4] to compute normalized Total Length (TL_MST), Transport Efficiency (MD_MST), and Fault Tolerance (FT), reproducing Tero et al. (2010) Science Fig. 3/4 and Tokyo rail Pareto optimality at gamma = 1.8.",
            "remediation needed: Verify Murray's cube law (r_0^3 = r_1^3 + r_2^3) at gamma = 4/3 on Y-junction bifurcations and verify two-path shortest-path selection across gamma < 1, gamma = 1, and gamma > 1." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.528"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 057 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

